- Read `docs/policies/approvals.md` when approval scope, push intent, or runtime escalation matters.
- Read `docs/policies/documentation-memory.md` and `docs/policies/cost-control.md` only when the request touches durable memory or billable/API routes.

## Conditional Reading

- For repo-owned Codex skill creation, review, or installation work, inspect `skills/` and apply the relevant `SKILL.md` package instructions.
