- For `CubelessStylized` or legacy `unreal-mcp-cubeless` work, read their copied project bindings only when the user explicitly names that external repository. Do not apply those bindings to `UnrealMCP5_6_1`.

## Workspace Bootstrap

- Do not assume that Cubeless workspaces live on a fixed drive such as `C:`, `D:`, or `F:`.
- Treat the parent of this `codex/` directory as the active `UnrealMCP5_6_1` repository root.
