- Do not rewrite upstream files broadly. Keep Cubeless extensions isolated and easy to review.
- For upstream update requests such as `최신 업데이트`, `업데이트 받아줘`, `원본 pull`, `upstream 최신`, or equivalent wording, apply `codex/docs/workflows/mcp-upstream-update.md`.
